e" id="Seg_833" s="T2" e="T3">((0.1s)) </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_835" s="T3" e="T4">Sì, buona sera a tu</ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_837" s="T4" e="T5">tti. </ts></ts><ts n="sc" id="Seg_838" s="T9" e="T31"><ts n="e" id="Seg_840" s="T9" e="T10">((0.4s)) </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_842" s="T10" e="T11">No, ma io innanzitutto sono m/ molto dispiaciuto de/ ((respira)) del fatto </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_844" s="T11" e="T12">perché io stavooo </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_846" s="T12" e="T13">e/ e ci tengo a precisare che io nella vita </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_848" s="T13" e="T14">quando sbaglio ho sempre alzato la mano. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_850" s="T14" e="T15">Ma in questo caso</ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_852" s="T15" e="T16">((0.4s)) </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_854" s="T16" e="T17">Ehh non mi sento per niente </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_856" s="T17" e="T18">di aver sbagliato nel senso che </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_858" s="T18" e="T19">io ((0.3s)) stavo uscendo, </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_860" s="T19" e="T20">l’ho incrociato, </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_862" s="T20" e="T21">((respira)) </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_864" s="T21" e="T22">ci siamo messi a parlare dell’episodio </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_866" s="T22" e="T23">che il Signor Gasperini sa perfettamente, </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_868" s="T23" e="T24">((respira)) che è andata come è andata </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_870" s="T24" e="T25">perché nella vita ci sta </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_872" s="T25" e="T26">che poi le società cambiano, </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_874" s="T26" e="T27">((0.4s)) cambiano idea ((0.6s)) e quindi… </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_876" s="T27" e="T28">((0.1s)) </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_878" s="T28" e="T29">Innanzitutto io so/ sto benissimo a Parma, </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_880" s="T29" e="T30">sono felice </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_882" s="T30" e="T31">di essere a Parma. </ts></ts><ts n="sc" id="Seg_883" s="T33" e="T35"><ts n="e" id="Seg_885" s="T33" e="T34">Ma a me/ m</ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_887" s="T34" e="T35">a me…</ts></ts><ts n="sc" id="Seg_888" s="T36" e="T42"><ts n="e" id="Seg_890" s="T36" e="T37">E io/ e io/ io as</ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_892" s="T37" e="T38">solutamente </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_894" s="T38" e="T39">eero/ ero inn/ in trattati/ </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_896" s="T39" e="T41">((0.3s)) </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_898" s="T41" e="T42">in trattativa. </ts></ts><ts n="sc" id="Seg_899" s="T43" e="T62"><ts n="e" id="Seg_901" s="T43" e="T44">No in tratta</ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_903" s="T44" e="T45">tive co/ in trattative con loro, </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_905" s="T45" e="T46">ne abbiamo parlato, </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_907" s="T46" e="T47">sciamo incrociati e ne abbiamo parlato. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_909" s="T47" e="T48">((respira)) </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_911" s="T48" e="T49">a un certo momento gli ho detto: </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_913" s="T49" e="T50">((respira)) </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_915" s="T50" e="T51">"per me, se voi avete deciso </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_917" s="T51" e="T52">di non/ di non fare l’operazione o di cambiare, </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_919" s="T52" e="T53">o di non parlare più con me, </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_921" s="T53" e="T54">credo che nella vita si possa alzare il telefono e dire </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_923" s="T54" e="T55">'Guarda Christian, non ci vogliamo più vedere, </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_925" s="T55" e="T56">non/ non si fa più niente ((0.3s)) e si va avanti.'"</ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_927" s="T56" e="T57">((respira)) </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_929" s="T57" e="T58">A quel momento lì lui/ ((0.2s)) io gli ho detto, </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_931" s="T58" e="T59">perché nella vita bisogna saper campare, </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_933" s="T59" e="T60">saper anche telefonare e dire </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_935" s="T60" e="T61">"guarda, non vogliamo più fare l’operazione, punto e ba</ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_937" s="T61" e="T62">sta". </ts></ts></segmentation><annotation name="en" tierref="TIE2"><ta id="Seg_938" s="T2" e="T5">Yes , good evening everyone .  </ta><ta id="Seg_939" s="T9" e="T14">No , but first of all I'm m / very sorry de / of the fact because I wasoo and / and I would like to point out that in life when I make a mistake I always raise my hand .   </ta><ta id="Seg_940" s="T14" e="T27">But in this case Ehh I don't feel at all wrong in the sense that I was going out, I met him, we started talking about the episode that Mr Gasperini knows perfectly well, that it went the way it went because in life it's normal that societies change, they change their minds and so ... </ta><ta id="Seg_941" s="T27" e="T31">First of all I know / I'm very well in Parma, I'm happy to be in Parma.  </ta><ta id="Seg_942" s="T33" e="T35">But to me / but me ...</ta><ta id="Seg_943" s="T36" e="T42">And I / and I / I absolutely eero / was inn / in negotiations .  </ta><ta id="Seg_944" s="T43" e="T47">No in negotiations co / in negotiations with them , we talked about it , we crossed paths and we talked about it. </ta><ta id="Seg_945" s="T47" e="T56">At a certain moment I told him : " for me , if you decided not / not to do the operation or to change , or not to talk to me anymore , I believe that in life you can pick up the phone and say ' Look Christian , we don't want to see each other anymore , we don't / don't do anything anymore and we move on . ' " </ta><ta id="Seg_946" s="T56" e="T62">At that moment there he / I told him , because in life you have to know how to live , you also have to know how to phone and say " look , we don't want to do the operation anymore , full stop " .  </ta></annotation></segmented-tier><segmented-tier id="TIE1" speaker="SPK0" category="v" type="t" display-name="C [v]"><timeline-fork start="T1" end="T2"><tli id="T1.TIE1.1"/>
